    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Support The Game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456650/extras/b09490a71bd07b510fae356c1d35e2d1.avif?t=1753955558\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456650/extras/bbb334c7979e41b02ba9e4ad5e3a12e6.avif?t=1753955558\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a demon, working off a debt in a mining operation deeper than hell itself. Your job is simple: extract soul crystals to meet the Devil\u2019s quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission drops you and your crew into procedurally generated caves. The layout changes every time, and the deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets. <strong>No maps. No guidance.</strong> <strong>Only your tools</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be equipped with basic mining gear but the tools you bring won\u2019t always be enough. If you make it back with enough crystals, you can use your earnings to buy better equipment between runs. But survival\u2019s never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together. Communicate. And don\u2019t make noise.</strong> The creatures in these caves don\u2019t care about your quota, and they\u2019re always watching, always waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t fight them. You can\u2019t outrun them.<br>The only way out is to work fast, stay quiet, and make it to the surface before the lift seals shut. Keep your crew alive, or risk losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456650/extras/34e56c00fb4e9f6836b864e36295a997.avif?t=1753955558\" width=800 height=65 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op horror</strong> for 1\u20134 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated cave networks</strong>\u2014new tunnels, new paths, new risks with every mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract soul crystals</strong> to meet your quota. The longer you take, the harder it gets to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use mining gear and support equipment</strong>\u2014lights, comms, and more. The better tools you bring, the better your chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy better gear between runs</strong>\u2014if you survive long enough to spend your cut. Choose upgrades, tools, or additional supplies to prepare for the next descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid creatures</strong> that hunt in the dark. They track you by sound and movement\u2014there's no fighting them, only evading them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay too long, and the odds turn against you</strong>. The deeper you go, the more the environment itself becomes hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a hero. You\u2019re just a miner.<br><strong>Don\u2019t miss your quota. Or don\u2019t come back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456650/extras/bbb334c7979e41b02ba9e4ad5e3a12e6.avif?t=1753955558\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a demon, working off a debt in a mining operation deeper than hell itself. Your job is simple: extract soul crystals to meet the Devil\u2019s quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission drops you and your crew into procedurally generated caves. The layout changes every time, and the deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets. <strong>No maps. No guidance.</strong> <strong>Only your tools</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be equipped with basic mining gear but the tools you bring won\u2019t always be enough. If you make it back with enough crystals, you can use your earnings to buy better equipment between runs. But survival\u2019s never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together. Communicate. And don\u2019t make noise.</strong> The creatures in these caves don\u2019t care about your quota, and they\u2019re always watching, always waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t fight them. You can\u2019t outrun them.<br>The only way out is to work fast, stay quiet, and make it to the surface before the lift seals shut. Keep your crew alive, or risk losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456650/extras/34e56c00fb4e9f6836b864e36295a997.avif?t=1753955558\" width=800 height=65 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op horror</strong> for 1\u20134 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated cave networks</strong>\u2014new tunnels, new paths, new risks with every mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract soul crystals</strong> to meet your quota. The longer you take, the harder it gets to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use mining gear and support equipment</strong>\u2014lights, comms, and more. The better tools you bring, the better your chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy better gear between runs</strong>\u2014if you survive long enough to spend your cut. Choose upgrades, tools, or additional supplies to prepare for the next descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid creatures</strong> that hunt in the dark. They track you by sound and movement\u2014there's no fighting them, only evading them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay too long, and the odds turn against you</strong>. The deeper you go, the more the environment itself becomes hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a hero. You\u2019re just a miner.<br><strong>Don\u2019t miss your quota. Or don\u2019t come back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Devil\u2019s Crew is a co-op horror game where 1\u20134 players explore procedurally generated caves to extract soul crystals for the Devil. Use mining tools, avoid deadly creatures and survive long enough to upgrade your gear. Time\u2019s always running out and the deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets.",
